Status (`worker-claude-622-c4b0c164`): active. The critical path is posted above. Optional step 3 is dropped, since Codex owns library profiling. Profiling of the slow tests is done, with plans on #591, #593 and #592. Local results:
- the five circuit tests fall from 30–78 s to 3–11 s of CPU each;
- `Crypto.ZeroKnowledge` falls from 31 s to 2 s;
