- MINKT's unary (x, 1^t, 1^s) encoding and honest NP witness;
- GapMINKT's no-condition, which matches Hirahara 2018 Def. II.6;
- Kt = min |p| + ⌈log₂ s⌉;
- PartialMCSP (an `Option Bool` table of length 2^n, De Morgan all-gate size, Ilango's AND/OR count);
- BPIS: the two formulations, proved equivalent;
